  "cil_liability": null,
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;The proposed extension to the front boundary wall and installation of the 1.6 metre high sliding entrance gate, by reason of their height, solid appearance and cumulative extent, would result in an unduly dominant and visually obtrusive boundary treatment that would appear incongruous within the street scene and conflict with the prevailing pattern and character of development. The proposal would therefore be contrary to Policy D3 of the London Plan (2021), Policy GR1 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021–2041) and the National Planning Policy Framework (2026).&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt;&quot;&gt;In the absence of a Reasonable Exception Statement, it has not been demonstrated that the proposal would satisfactorily address fire safety, contrary to National Planning Policy Framework (2026), Policy D12 A of the London Plan (2021) and Policy GR3B of The Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ]
